# Keep this list identical to `functions.api/index.py.excludeFiles` in
# vercel.json. `vercel build` traces the function's files from everything
# *excludeFiles* leaves in, while `vercel deploy` uploads only what this file
# leaves in — anything listed here but not there is referenced by the build
# yet never uploaded, and the deployment fails with ENOENT.
#
# Everything here is either a local artefact (virtualenv, caches, SQLite
# snapshots of 300 MB+ each) or unrelated tooling; the function bundle also
# has a hard 500 MB limit that these alone would blow through.
venv/
_uv/
.agents/
.vercel/
.claude/
.git/
node_modules/
.next/
media/
__pycache__/
*.db
*.xlsx
